OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners speak out about
OL,4,Arevised local plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to put 300 properties on a
OL,7,Fgolf course have been removed from a
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire council's plan to
OL,9,Fbuild up to 47,300 new homes by 2043.
OL,11,FBut a potential 1,000 homes are still
OL,12,Fearmarked for the village of Long
OL,13,FBuckby, near Daventry, where residents
OL,14,Ffear the fabric of their community will
OL,15,Fbe destroyed.
OL,17,FThe local plan is set to go to the
OL,18,FReform UK-led West Northamptonshire
OL,19,FCouncil's planning policy committee,
OL,20,Fwhich will decide on its future.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
